{"type":"sar","campaignTitle":{"de":"PROJEKT: ZEPHYR","en":"PROJECT: ZEPHYR"},"campaignSublines":[{"de":"Erneuerbare Energien, echte Gefahren.","en":"Green energy, real dangers."},{"de":"Wartungseinsatz im Offshore-Windpark.","en":"Maintenance in the offshore wind farm."}],"levels":[{"headline":{"de":"1. Versorgungsflug","en":"1. Supply Run"},"briefing":{"de":"Guten Morgen, Wolf. Routinetransfer – die Plattform braucht ihre Crew. Der Ladekran ist ausgefallen, also holen Sie die Lieferung direkt von der Versorgungsvessel ab. Das Pad ist voll beladen. Zwei Rotationen, dann haben wir's.","en":"Good morning, Wolf. Routine transfer – the platform needs its crew. The loading crane is down, so collect the delivery directly from the supply vessel. The pad is fully loaded. Two rotations and we're done."},"gridSize":120,"terrain":"0x14641","spawnObject":"carrier","objects":[{"type":"carrier","x":20,"y":20,"path":"static"},{"type":"research_platform","x":80,"y":80}],"payloads":[{"type":"crate","x":20,"y":20,"attachTo":{"objectType":"carrier","objectIdx":0,"localX":4,"localY":0}}],"objectives":[{"type":"rescue_all"}]},{"headline":{"de":"2. Ikarus' Atem","en":"2. Icarus' Breath"},"briefing":{"de":"Jetzt wird es ernst. Die automatische Bremse an Turbine 4 ist ausgefallen! Sie müssen den Cheftechniker direkt auf der Gondel absetzen. Der Rotor dreht sich noch langsam – halten Sie Abstand zu den Blättern und nutzen Sie die Winde!","en":"Things are getting serious. The automatic brake on Turbine 4 has failed! You must drop the chief technician directly onto the nacelle. The rotor is still spinning slowly – stay clear of the blades and use the winch!"},"gridSize":150,"terrain":"0x22801","spawnObject":"carrier","rain":true,"windStr":3.2,"objects":[{"type":"carrier","x":20,"y":50,"angle":90,"path":"straight","speed":2},{"type":"wind_turbine","x":80,"y":80,"rescueZones":[{"x":0.3,"y":0,"w":1,"h":1,"role":"dropoff"}]}],"payloads":[{"type":"person","x":20,"y":50,"attachTo":{"objectType":"carrier","objectIdx":0,"localX":4,"localY":0}}],"objectives":[{"type":"rescue_all"}]},{"headline":{"de":"3. Brennende Gondel","en":"3. Burning Nacelle"},"briefing":{"de":"Wolf, Turbine 4 brennt. Die Reparatur hat nicht gereicht. Drei Personen auf der Gondel, kein Weg runter. Sturm zieht auf. Sie kennen den Weg.","en":"Wolf, Turbine 4 is on fire. The repair didn't hold. Three people on the nacelle, no way down. Storm's moving in. You know the way."},"gridSize":150,"terrain":"0x22801","spawnObject":"carrier","rain":true,"night":true,"windStr":5.0,"objects":[{"type":"carrier","x":15,"y":80,"path":"static"},{"type":"supply_vessel","x":48,"y":80,"path":"static"},{"type":"sar_boat","x":70,"y":55,"path":"static"},{"type":"sar_boat","x":105,"y":30,"path":"static"},{"type":"pilot_boat","x":62,"y":70,"path":"static"},{"type":"wind_turbine","x":82,"y":38,"rescueZones":[{"x":0.3,"y":0,"w":1,"h":1,"role":"pickup"}]},{"type":"wind_turbine","x":97,"y":38,"rescueZones":[{"x":0.3,"y":0,"w":1,"h":1,"role":"pickup"}]},{"type":"wind_turbine","x":112,"y":38,"rescueZones":[{"x":0.3,"y":0,"w":1,"h":1,"role":"pickup"}]},{"type":"wind_turbine","x":82,"y":55,"rescueZones":[{"x":0.3,"y":0,"w":1,"h":1,"role":"pickup"}]},{"type":"wind_turbine","x":97,"y":55,"rescueZones":[{"x":0.3,"y":0,"w":1,"h":1,"role":"pickup"}]},{"type":"wind_turbine","x":112,"y":55,"rescueZones":[{"x":0.3,"y":0,"w":1,"h":1,"role":"pickup"}]},{"type":"wind_turbine","x":89,"y":72,"rescueZones":[{"x":0.3,"y":0,"w":1,"h":1,"role":"pickup"}]},{"type":"wind_turbine","x":104,"y":72,"rescueZones":[{"x":0.3,"y":0,"w":1,"h":1,"role":"pickup"}]},{"type":"wind_turbine","x":119,"y":72,"rescueZones":[{"x":0.3,"y":0,"w":1,"h":1,"role":"pickup"}]}],"payloads":[{"type":"person","x":82,"y":55,"attachTo":{"objectType":"wind_turbine","objectIdx":3,"localX":0.3,"localY":0}},{"type":"person","x":82,"y":55,"attachTo":{"objectType":"wind_turbine","objectIdx":3,"localX":0.3,"localY":0.5}},{"type":"person","x":82,"y":55,"attachTo":{"objectType":"wind_turbine","objectIdx":3,"localX":0.3,"localY":-0.5}}],"objectives":[{"type":"rescue_all"}]}]}